---
// jsal.ui, John's free WoW Forever addon: what it is, where to get it and
// how to install it. Layout C of three mockups (6 Nov 2026) without its web
// Daily Word card: a game played here would give away the in-game word and
// let guildmates inflate their scores, so the word stays in the addon. The
// addon's code and releases are on GitHub (superjsal/jsal-ui). First shipped at
// /jsal.ui/, moved to /jsal-ui/ the same day to match the repo's name; site/_redirects
// sends the old address here.
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import TopBar from "../../components/TopBar.astro";
const RELEASES = "https://github.com/superjsal/jsal-ui/releases/latest";
const REPO = "https://github.com/superjsal/jsal-ui";
---
<Page
  title="jsal.ui: a free WoW Forever addon | jsal.io"
  description="jsal.ui is a free WoW Forever addon: a Daily Word, chess and other games for your guild, talent, training and profession planners, and easy helpers."
  path="/jsal-ui/"
  ogDescription="A free WoW Forever addon: daily games and chess for your guild, talent, training and profession planners, and easy helpers."
>
<style is:inline slot="head">
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; color: var(--jsal-ink); font: 15px/1.6 var(--jsal-font); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
.wrap { max-width: calc(var(--jsal-col) + 40px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--jsal-gutter) var(--jsal-page-end); }
.addon { margin-top: var(--jsal-page-top); max-width: 40em; }
.code { margin: 0 0 var(--jsal-space-12); font: 500 12px/1.5 "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--jsal-accent); }
h1 { margin: 0; font: 700 46px/1.05 "Lora", Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }   /* every page title's size */
@media (max-width: 520px) { h1 { font-size: 40px; } }
h1 em { font-weight: 600; color: var(--jsal-accent); }
.lead { margin: var(--jsal-space-20) 0 0; font-size: 17px; color: var(--jsal-ink-2); text-wrap: pretty; }
.actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--jsal-space-8); margin-top: var(--jsal-space-24); }
.meta { margin: var(--jsal-space-12) 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--jsal-muted); }
.addon a:not(.jsal-btn) { color: var(--jsal-accent); text-underline-offset: 2px; }
.has { margin: var(--jsal-space-32) 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: var(--jsal-space-8); }
.has li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 20px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--jsal-space-8); color: var(--jsal-ink-2); }
.has li::before { content: ""; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin: var(--jsal-space-8) 0 0 var(--jsal-space-4); background: var(--jsal-fill); transform: rotate(45deg); }   /* the logo's gem as the bullet */
.has b { color: var(--jsal-ink); }
.addon h2 { margin: var(--jsal-space-48) 0 var(--jsal-space-8); font: 700 24px/1.25 "Lora", Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.addon h3 { margin: var(--jsal-space-24) 0 var(--jsal-space-4); font: 700 17px/1.4 var(--jsal-font); }
.addon p:not(.code):not(.meta), .addon ol li { color: var(--jsal-ink-2); }
.addon ol { margin: 0 0 var(--jsal-flow); padding-left: 1.3em; }
.addon ol li + li { margin-top: var(--jsal-space-4); }
.addon .steps + p, .addon h3 + p { margin: 0 0 var(--jsal-flow); }
.addon code { font: 500 13px "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace; }
</style>
<div class="wrap">
  <TopBar><nav aria-label="Sections"><a href="/play/" data-jsal-nav>Off the clock</a><a href="#install">Install</a></nav></TopBar>
  <main class="addon">
    <p class="code">For WoW Forever</p>
    <h1>jsal.<em>ui</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">A free UI pack, daily games and easy helpers for WoW Forever. One install, no subscription.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="jsal-btn primary" href={RELEASES}>Download jsal.ui</a>
      <a class="jsal-btn" href="#install">How to install</a>
    </div>
    <p class="meta">Version 0.3.13 · free, with its code <a href={REPO}>on GitHub</a></p>
    <ul class="has">
      <li><span><b>Made to sit beside EllesmereUI,</b> the free UI, in the same dark, clean style, or to work on its own.</span></li>
      <li><span><b>Daily Word, Icon Guess and the Guild Word,</b> the same for everyone each day, with a Guild tab of today's scores.</span></li>
      <li><span><b>Chess with your guildmates,</b> with a win-loss record and their games to watch as they're played.</span></li>
      <li><span><b>Build Planner</b> for every class's Forever talents, with a ready-made leveling build to follow, Wowhead links in and out, and your next talent marked in the game's talent window.</span></li>
      <li><span><b>Training and Professions:</b> what's ready to train, your road to 60, each profession's road to the next rank, and the nearest trainer.</span></li>
      <li><span><b>A flight bar</b> with your route, the time left and today's games.</span></li>
      <li><span><b>Easy helpers:</b> quests on autopilot, a vendor run, level-up tips, bag and gear warnings.</span></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="install">How to install</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><a href={RELEASES}>Download jsal.ui</a> and unzip it into <code>World of Warcraft\_forever_\Interface\AddOns</code>, so you have an <code>AddOns\jsalUI</code> folder.</li>
      <li>Log in, or type <code>/reload</code>, then type <code>/jsal</code>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Every part has a switch in <code>/jsal settings</code>, so turn off anything you don't want. It works on its own, or alongside <a href="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/ellesmereui">EllesmereUI</a> if you use it.</p>

    <h3>Is it really free?</h3>
    <p>Yes, all of it, with no subscription or Patreon tier. Its code is <a href={REPO}>on GitHub</a>.</p>
    <p>Made by John Salvador. Questions or ideas: <a href="mailto:dev@jsal.io">dev@jsal.io</a>.</p>
  </main>
</div>
</Page>
